11:[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Introduction"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"SoulX-Singer"}]," is a high-fidelity, zero-shot singing voice synthesis (SVS) model that generates realistic singing voices for unseen singers — with no fine-tuning required. It supports two flexible control modes for precise pitch, rhythm, and expression."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"SoulX-Singer-SVC"}]," is a companion singing voice conversion (SVC) model fine-tuned from SoulX-Singer. It transforms a source singing recording into a target singer's voice while preserving melody, rhythm, and lyrical content — without requiring lyric or MIDI transcriptions."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Key Features"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Singing Voice Synthesis (SVS)"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zero-Shot Singing"}]," — Generate high-fidelity voices for unseen singers without any fine-tuning."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Flexible Control Modes"}]," — Melody (F0 contour) and Score (MIDI) conditioning."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Large-Scale Training"}]," — 42,000+ hours of aligned vocals, lyrics, and notes across Mandarin, English, and Cantonese."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Timbre Cloning"}]," — Preserve singer identity across languages, styles, and edited lyrics."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Singing Voice Editing"}]," — Modify lyrics while retaining natural prosody."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Cross-Lingual Synthesis"}]," — High-fidelity synthesis via disentangled timbre from content."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Singing Voice Conversion (SVC)"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zero-Shot Timbre and Style Transfer"}]," — Transfer singer identity and style to unseen voices without per-speaker fine-tuning."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Language-Agnostic Conversion"}]," — Works across multilingual singing content."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Transcription-Free Audio-to-Audio"}]," — Convert singing directly from audio without lyrics or MIDI inputs."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Architecture"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"SoulX-Singer is built on the strong generative capability of flow-matching, trained on an industry-scale dataset. The model disentangles timbre from content, enabling robust cross-lingual and cross-style synthesis. SVC capability is added by fine-tuning SoulX-Singer on audio-to-audio conversion objectives."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Resources"}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Resource"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Link"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Paper (arXiv)"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.07803","children":"arXiv:2602.07803"}]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Online Demo"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer","children":"Hugging Face Spaces"}]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Model Weights"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://huggingface.co/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer","children":"Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer"}]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"MIDI Editor"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer-Midi-Editor","children":"HF Space"}]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Eval Dataset"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer-Eval-Dataset","children":"Soul-AILab/SoulX-Singer-Eval-Dataset"}]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"GitHub"}],"$L13"]}]]}]]}],"\n","$L14","\n","$L15"]
